    "title": "When heart-bound desires are released",
    "gloss": "When all the desires lodged in a person's heart are released, then the mortal becomes deathless and here attains Brahman.",
    "explanation": "Deathlessness is located 'here,' not postponed only to another world. The verse identifies liberation with release from desires that bind the heart; it does not offer a modern psychological claim that every preference or motivation is pathological.",
